msgstr "%P"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:204
msgid "the process ID of the SSSD client"
msgstr "l'ID del procés del client SSSD"

#. type: Content of: <varlistentry><listitem><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:209 include/override_homedir.xml:68
msgid "%%"
msgstr "%%"

#. type: Content of: <varlistentry><listitem><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:210 include/override_homedir.xml:69
msgid "a literal '%'"
msgstr "un literal «%»"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:164
msgid ""
"Location of the user's credential cache. Three credential cache types are "
"currently supported: <quote>FILE</quote>, <quote>DIR</quote> and "
"<quote>KEYRING:persistent</quote>. The cache can be specified either as "
"<replaceable>TYPE:RESIDUAL</replaceable>, or as an absolute path, which "
"implies the <quote>FILE</quote> type. In the template, the following "
"sequences are substituted: <placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/> If "
"the template ends with 'XXXXXX' mkstemp(3) is used to create a unique "
"filename in a safe way."
msgstr ""
"Ubicació de la memòria cau de credencials de l'usuari. Actualment s'admeten "
"tres tipus de memòria cau de credencials: <quote>FILE</quote>, <quote>DIR</"
"quote>i <quote>KEYRING:persistent</quote>. La memòria cau es pot especificar "
"com a <replaceable>TYPE:RESIDUAL</replaceable>, o com un camí absolut, que "
"implica el tipus <quote>FILE</quote> . A la plantilla, se substitueixen les "
"següents seqüències: <placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/> Si la "
"plantilla acaba amb 'XXXXXX' mkstemp(3) s'utilitza per crear un nom de "
"fitxer únic de manera segura."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:218
msgid ""
"When using KEYRING types, the only supported mechanism is "
"<quote>KEYRING:persistent:%U</quote>, which uses the Linux kernel keyring to "
"store credentials on a per-UID basis. This is also the recommended choice, "
"as it is the most secure and predictable method."
msgstr ""
"Quan s'utilitzen tipus KEYRING, l'únic mecanisme suportat és <quote>"
"KEYRING:persistent:%U</quote>, que utilitza l'anell de claus del nucli Linux "
"per emmagatzemar les credencials sobre una base per UID. Aquesta és també "
"l'elecció recomanada, ja que és el mètode més segur i predictible."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:226
msgid ""
"The default value for the credential cache name is sourced from the profile "
"stored in the system wide krb5.conf configuration file in the [libdefaults] "
"section. The option name is default_ccache_name.  See krb5.conf(5)'s "
"PARAMETER EXPANSION paragraph for additional information on the expansion "
"format defined by krb5.conf."
msgstr ""
"El valor predeterminat per al nom de la memòria cau de credencials prové del "
"perfil emmagatzemat al fitxer de configuració krb5.conf del sistema "
"d'amplada a la secció [libdefaults]. El nom de l'opció és "
"defaultccachename.  Vegeu el paràgraf EXPANSIÓ DEL PARÀMETRE krb5.conf(5) "
"per a obtenir informació addicional sobre el format d'expansió definit pel "
"krb5.conf."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:235
msgid ""
"NOTE: Please be aware that libkrb5 ccache expansion template from "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>krb5.conf</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</"
"manvolnum> </citerefentry> uses different expansion sequences than SSSD."
msgstr ""
"NOTA: Tingueu en compte que la plantilla d'expansió ccache de libkrb5 de "
"<citerefentry> <refentrytitle>krb5.conf</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</"
"manvolnum> </citerefentry> utilitza seqüències d'expansió diferents de "
"l'SSSD."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:244
msgid "Default: (from libkrb5)"
msgstr "Per defecte: (del libkrb5)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:250
msgid "krb5_keytab (string)"
msgstr "krb5_keytab (cadena)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:253
msgid ""
"The location of the keytab to use when validating credentials obtained from "
"KDCs."
msgstr ""
"La ubicació de la keytab a usar quan es validin les credencials obtingudes "
"de KDC."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:263
msgid "krb5_store_password_if_offline (boolean)"
msgstr "krb5_store_password_if_offline (booleà)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:266
msgid ""
"Store the password of the user if the provider is offline and use it to "
"request a TGT when the provider comes online again."
msgstr ""
"Emmagatzema la contrasenya de l'usuari si el proveïdor està fora de línia i "
"l'utilitza per sol·licitar un TGT quan el proveïdor torni a estar en línia."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:271
msgid ""
"NOTE: this feature is only available on Linux.  Passwords stored in this way "
"are kept in plaintext in the kernel keyring and are potentially accessible "
"by the root user (with difficulty)."
msgstr ""
"NOTA: aquesta característica només està disponible a Linux.  Les "
"contrasenyes emmagatzemades d'aquesta manera es mantenen en text pla a "
"l'anell de claus del nucli i són potencialment accessibles per l'usuari root "
"(amb dificultat)."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:284
msgid "krb5_use_fast (string)"
msgstr "krb5_use_fast (cadena)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:287
msgid ""
"Enables flexible authentication secure tunneling (FAST) for Kerberos pre-"
"authentication. The following options are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Habilita un túnel segur d'autenticació flexible (FAST) per a la "
"preautenticació de Kerberos. S'admeten les següents opcions:"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:292
msgid ""
"<emphasis>never</emphasis> use FAST. This is equivalent to not setting this "
"option at all."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>mai</emphasis> usa ràpid. Això equival a no establir aquesta opció "
"en absolut."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:296
msgid ""
"<emphasis>try</emphasis> to use FAST. If the server does not support FAST, "
"continue the authentication without it."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>intenta</emphasis> per utilitzar FAST. Si el servidor no admet "
"FAST, continua l'autenticació sense ell."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:301
msgid ""
"<emphasis>demand</emphasis> to use FAST. The authentication fails if the "
"server does not support FAST."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>demana</emphasis> per utilitzar FAST. L'autenticació falla si el "
"servidor no admet FAST."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:306
msgid "Default: not set, i.e. FAST is not used."
msgstr "Per defecte: no s'ha establert, és a dir, no s'utilitza FAST."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:309
msgid "NOTE: a keytab or support for anonymous PKINIT is required to use FAST."
msgstr ""
"NOTA: es requereix un keytab o suport per a PKINIT anònim per utilitzar FAST."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:313
msgid ""
"NOTE: SSSD supports FAST only with MIT Kerberos version 1.8 and later. If "
"SSSD is used with an older version of MIT Kerberos, using this option is a "
"configuration error."
msgstr ""
"NOTA: SSSD només suporta FAST amb la versió 1.8 i posterior de MIT Kerberos. "
"Si SSSD s'utilitza amb una versió antiga del Kerberos del MIT, l'ús "
"d'aquesta opció és un error de configuració."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:322
msgid "krb5_fast_principal (string)"
msgstr "krb5_fast_principal (cadena)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:325
msgid "Specifies the server principal to use for FAST."
msgstr "Especifica el servidor principal a utilitzar per FAST."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:331
msgid "krb5_fast_use_anonymous_pkinit (boolean)"
msgstr "krb5_use_kdcinfo (booleà)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:334
msgid ""
"If set to true try to use anonymous PKINIT instead of a keytab to get the "
"required credential for FAST. The krb5_fast_principal options is ignored in "
"this case."
msgstr ""
"Si s'estableix a cert, intenteu utilitzar PKINIT anònim en lloc d'una clau "
"per obtenir la credencial requerida per FAST. En aquest cas s'ignoren les "
"opcions del krb5fastprincipal."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:374
msgid "krb5_kdcinfo_lookahead (string)"
msgstr "krb5kdcinfolookahead (cadena)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:377
msgid ""
"When krb5_use_kdcinfo is set to true, you can limit the amount of servers "
"handed to <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd_krb5_locator_plugin</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> </citerefentry>.  This might be "
"helpful when there are too many servers discovered using SRV record."
msgstr ""
"Quan el krb5usekdcinfo està establert a true, podeu limitar la quantitat de "
"servidors lliurats a <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssdkrb5locatorplugin</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> </citerefentry>.  Això pot ser útil "
"quan hi ha massa servidors descoberts utilitzant el registre SRV."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:387
msgid ""
"The krb5_kdcinfo_lookahead option contains two numbers separated by a colon. "
"The first number represents number of primary servers used and the second "
"number specifies the number of backup servers."
msgstr ""
"L'opció krb5kdcinfolookahead conté dos nombres separats per dos punts. El "
"primer número representa el nombre de servidors primaris utilitzats i el "
"segon número especifica el nombre de servidors de còpia de seguretat."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:393
msgid ""
"For example <emphasis>10:0</emphasis> means that up to 10 primary servers "
"will be handed to <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd_krb5_locator_plugin</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> </citerefentry> but no backup "
"servers."
msgstr ""
"Per exemple, <emphasis>10:0</emphasis> significa que fins a 10 servidors "
"primaris es lliuraran a <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssdkrb5locatorplugin</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>8</manvolnum> </citerefentry> però sense servidors "
"de còpia de seguretat."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:402
msgid "Default: 3:1"
msgstr "Per defecte: 3:1"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:408
msgid "krb5_use_enterprise_principal (boolean)"
msgstr "krb5_use_enterprise_principal (booleà)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:411
msgid ""
"Specifies if the user principal should be treated as enterprise principal. "
"See section 5 of RFC 6806 for more details about enterprise principals."
msgstr ""
"Indica si el principal de l'usuari ha de ser tractat com a principal de "
"l'empresa. Vegeu la secció 5 de la RFC 6806 per a més detalls sobre els "
"principals empresarials."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:417
msgid "Default: false (AD provider: true)"
msgstr "Per defecte: false (proveïdor d'anuncis: true)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:420
msgid ""
"The IPA provider will set to option to 'true' if it detects that the server "
"is capable of handling enterprise principals and the option is not set "
"explicitly in the config file."
msgstr ""
"El proveïdor IPA establirà l'opció a 'true' si detecta que el servidor és "
"capaç de gestionar els principals empresarials i l'opció no s'estableix "
"explícitament al fitxer de configuració."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:429
msgid "krb5_use_subdomain_realm (boolean)"
msgstr "krb5_use_kdcinfo (booleà)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:432
msgid ""
"Specifies to use subdomains realms for the authentication of users from "
"trusted domains. This option can be set to 'true' if enterprise principals "
"are used with upnSuffixes which are not known on the parent domain KDCs. If "
"the option is set to 'true' SSSD will try to send the request directly to a "
"KDC of the trusted domain the user is coming from."
msgstr ""
"Especifica l'ús de dominis de subdominis per a l'autenticació d'usuaris de "
"dominis de confiança. Aquesta opció es pot establir a 'true' si s'utilitzen "
"principis empresarials amb upnSuffixs que no es coneixen en els KDC del "
"domini pare. Si l'opció està establerta a 'true' SSSD intentarà enviar la "
"sol·licitud directament a un KDC del domini de confiança del qual prové "
"l'usuari."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:448
msgid "krb5_map_user (string)"
msgstr "krb5_map_user (cadena)"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:451
msgid ""
"The list of mappings is given as a comma-separated list of pairs "
"<quote>username:primary</quote> where <quote>username</quote> is a UNIX user "
"name and <quote>primary</quote> is a user part of a kerberos principal. This "
"mapping is used when user is authenticating using <quote>auth_provider = "
"krb5</quote>."
msgstr ""
"La llista de mapes es dona com una llista separada per comes de parells "
"<quote>username:primary</quote> on <quote>username</quote> és un nom "
"d'usuari UNIX i <quote>primary</quote> és una part d'usuari d'un kerberos "
"principal. Aquest mapatge s'utilitza quan l'usuari s'està autenticant "
"utilitzant <quote>authprovider . krb5</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para><programlisting>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:463
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"krb5_realm = REALM\n"
"krb5_map_user = joe:juser,dick:richard\n"
msgstr ""
"krb5_realm = REALM\n"
"krb5_map_user = joe:juser,dick:richard\n"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:468
msgid ""
"<quote>joe</quote> and <quote>dick</quote> are UNIX user names and "
"<quote>juser</quote> and <quote>richard</quote> are primaries of kerberos "
"principals. For user <quote>joe</quote> resp.  <quote>dick</quote> SSSD will "
"try to kinit as <quote>juser@REALM</quote> resp.  <quote>richard@REALM</"
"quote>."
msgstr ""
"<quote>joe</quote> i <quote>dick</quote> són noms d'usuari d'UNIX i <quote>"
"juser</quote> i <quote>richard</quote> són primàries de kerberos principals. "
"Per a l'usuari <quote>joe</quote> resp.  <quote>dick</quote> SSSD intentarà "
"kinit com a <quote>juser.REALM</quote> resp.  <quote>richard.REALM</quote>."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:65
msgid ""
"If the auth-module krb5 is used in an SSSD domain, the following options "
"must be used. See the <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>sssd.conf</"
"refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry> manual page, section "
"<quote>DOMAIN SECTIONS</quote>, for details on the configuration of an SSSD "
"domain.  <placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Si s'utilitza l'auth-module krb5 en un domini SSSD, s'han d'utilitzar les "
"següents opcions. Vegeu la pàgina del manual <citerefentry> <refentrytitle>"
"sssd.conf</refentrytitle> <manvolnum>5</manvolnum> </citerefentry>, secció "
"<quote>SECCIONS DEL DOMINI</quote>, per als detalls sobre la configuració "
"d'un domini SSSD.  <placeholder type=\"variablelist\" id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:495
msgid ""
"The following example assumes that SSSD is correctly configured and FOO is "
"one of the domains in the <replaceable>[sssd]</replaceable> section. This "
"example shows only configuration of Kerberos authentication; it does not "
"include any identity provider."
msgstr ""
"L'exemple següent assumeix que SSSD està correctament configurat i FOO és un "
"dels dominis de la secció <replaceable>[sssd]</replaceable>. Aquest exemple "
"només mostra la configuració de l'autenticació Kerberos; no inclou cap "
"proveïdor d'identitat."

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refsect1><para><programlisting>
#: sssd-krb5.5.xml:503
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[domain/FOO]\n"
"auth_provider = krb5\n"
"krb5_server = 192.168.1.1\n"
"krb5_realm = EXAMPLE.COM\n"
msgstr ""
"[domain/FOO]\n"
"auth_provider = krb5\n"
"krb5_server = 192.168.1.1\n"
"krb5_realm = EXEMPLE.COM\n"

#. type: Content of: <reference><refentry><refnamediv><refname>
